course: dictionary
lesson: 8704
title: Sen: money, a title and a name
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Sen is a small word with three jobs, so context matters. In «100 sen make 1 ringgit» from Malaysia, sen is a small coin, like a cent. In news from the USA, «Sen. Lee» means a senator, a politician who is a member of a senate. Look at the words around sen to find out which job it is doing.
explain: Sen can also be a small piece of a longer word or name. In «The 1911 Revolution began with an uprising in Wuchang... with Sun Yat-sen as provisional president», sen is part of the name Sun Yat-sen, not a word on its own. Do not stop at the sen. Read the whole name first.
explain: On its own, sen is rare in everyday English. If you meet it alone, check the clues: a number before it points to money, and a full stop after it with a name following points to a senator. Then ask: does my meaning fit this sentence?
fact: A sen is a small unit of money in some Asian countries.
fact: «100 sen» make 1 ringgit in Malaysia, so sen works like cents.
fact: In Japan, the sen was an old unit: 100 sen made 1 yen.
fact: «Sen.» is short for «Senator» and is written before a name.
fact: Sen can be part of a longer word or name, such as Sun Yat-sen.
exercise: «100 sen make 1 ringgit» in Malaysia. What is a sen? | A type of bird | A large city | A senator from America | *A small unit of money
exercise: «Sen. Lee spoke to the people of Ohio.» What does Sen. mean? | A sentence | *A senator, a member of a senate | A river in Malaysia | A kind of coin
exercise: Which word contains sen as part of a name? | Wuchang | *Sun Yat-sen | Revolution | Republic
test: In old Japan, how many sen made 1 yen? | 1000 | *100 | 10 | 50
test: «100 sen make 1 ringgit.» How many ringgit is 300 sen? | *3 | 0.3 | 30 | 300
exam: What is the best way to work out what sen means when you meet it? | Guess it is a fruit and move on | *Read the words around it and check your meaning fits the sentence | Skip the whole sentence and never return to it | Ask someone to spell it for you
